msgid "Using Kogito to add prediction capabilities to an application"
msgstr "使用Kogito为应用程序添加预测功能"

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use Kogito to add business automation\n"
"to power it up with predictions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Kogito is a next generation business automation toolkit that originates from the well known Open Source project\n"
"Drools (for predictions). Kogito aims at providing another approach\n"
"to business automation where the main message is to expose your business knowledge (processes, rules, decisions, predictions)\n"
"in a domain specific way."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "A working container runtime (Docker or xref:podman.adoc[Podman])"
msgstr ""

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "如果你想构建原生可执行程序，可以选择安装Mandrel或者GraalVM，并xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[正确配置](或者使用Docker在容器中进行构建)"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "应用结构"

msgid "In this example, we build a very simple microservice which offers one REST endpoint:"
msgstr ""

msgid "`/LogisticRegressionIrisData`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This endpoint will be automatically generated based on given PMML file, that in turn will\n"
"make use of generated code to make certain predictions based on the data being processed."
msgstr ""

msgid "PMML file"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The PMML file describes the prediction logic of our microservice.\n"
"It should provide the actual model (Regression, Tree, Scorecard, Clustering, etc.) needed to make the prediction."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prediction endpoints"
msgstr ""

msgid "Those are the entry points to the service that can be consumed by clients."
msgstr ""

msgid "Solution"
msgstr "解决方案"

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the complete example."
msgstr ""

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` ，或下载一个 {quickstarts-archive-url}[存档] 。"

msgid "The solution is located in the `kogito-pmml-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-url}/kogito-pmml-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Creating the Maven Project"
msgstr "创建Maven项目"

msgid "First, we need a new project. Create a new project with the following command:"
msgstr "首先，我们需要一个新的项目。使用以下命令创建一个新的项目:"

msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "创建Grade项目，请添加 `--gradle` 或者 `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` 参数。"

msgid "_For more information about how to install the Quarkus CLI and use it, please refer to xref:cli-tooling.adoc[the Quarkus CLI guide]._"
msgstr "_关于如何安装并使用Quarkus CLI的更多信息，请参考xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI指南]。_"

msgid "Maven"
msgstr "Maven"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "创建Grade项目，请添加 `-DbuildTool=gradle` 或者 `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` 参数。"

